// expect: a render target's samples are 1, 2, 4 or 8, and this says 16
// expect: each of its pixels is drawn with that many samples, which smooths the edges of the triangles drawn into it: 'RenderTarget.Window(samples: 4)'; a device that has fewer draws it with what it has
scene Main { }
view Show() { var target = RenderTarget.Window(0.5, samples: 16); }
